# Text is stored and checked out with LF everywhere. Card folders are hashed
# byte for byte (the "tree hash" in verified.json), so a CRLF checkout on
# Windows would make `neurosquad-card pack` print a different hash locally than
# the one the app computes from GitHub's archive.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
